  "name": "Baked Nectarines with Mascarpone, Pistachios, and Honey",
  "subtitle": "Warm nectarines with creamy mascarpone and a crisp nut topping",
  "description": "Roasted nectarines are served with mascarpone, honey, citrus, thyme, and chopped pistachios.",
